  <meta:content rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Quinine, a natural alkaloid extracted from the cinchona tree bark, is predominantly used as an anti-malaria drug and occasionally prescribed for lupus, arthritis, and muscle cramps.</meta:content>
