  <meta:file_path rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"></meta:file_path>
  <meta:content rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">In recent years, the quantitative electrochemical methods for quinine analysis have gained increasing attention due to rapid response, operational convenience, affordable instrumentation, and easy miniaturization.</meta:content>
