  <meta:content rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Du et al. developed a signal-amplifying electrochemiluminescence biosensor, leveraging a nucleic acid signal amplification technique and silver nanoclusters to effectively quantify quinine.</meta:content>
