  <meta:content rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Cyclodextrins (CDs) are second-generation macrocyclic molecules and one of the most commonly utilized recognition motifs due to their commercial availability, relative affordability, and excellent capability.</meta:content>
