  <meta:content rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Non-covalent interactions, such as Van der Waals forces, hydrogen bonding, and hydrophobic interactions, enable cyclodextrins to form stable host-guest inclusion complexes.</meta:content>
  <meta:type rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">entity</meta:type>
