  <meta:file_path rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"></meta:file_path>
  <meta:content rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A modest and smooth peak current was observed on the bare GC electrode, attributable to the physical adsorption of MB on the electrode surface.</meta:content>
