  <meta:content rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">After the deposition of reduced GO onto the GC electrode, a larger peak current was noted, due to the larger surface area provided by the wrinkled graphene and the π π stacking interaction between MB and graphene.</meta:content>
