  <meta:content rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The SEM images of GO/GC, (B) rGO/GC, (C) pNAANI/rGO/GC, and (D) β -CD/pNAANI/rGO/GC, and the CV and EIS results confirmed the successful preparation of the β-CD/pNAANI/rGO/GC electrode.</meta:content>
