  <meta:content rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">(Superclass: glass_carbon_electrode(GC)): The GO/GC electrode is a glass carbon electrode (GC) modified with graphene oxide, making it a specific type of glass carbon electrode.</meta:content>
