  <meta:content rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">(Superclass: glass_carbon_electrode(GC)): The beta-CD/pNAANI/rGO/GC electrode is a glass carbon electrode (GC) modified with reduced graphene oxide, poly(N-acetylaniline), and beta-cyclodextrin, making it a specific type of glass carbon electrode.</meta:content>
