  <meta:content rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Due to the host-guest recognition between the MB and β-CD molecule, the DPV peak current increased with the incubation time in the MB solution, reaching a stable value at 35 min.</meta:content>
