  <meta:content rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The outcome of this statistical comparison substantiated that there are no significant discrepancies, thereby demonstrating the potential of the proposed sensing platform for widespread and practical applications in real-world samples.</meta:content>
