  <meta:content rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The proposed sensing mechanism was investigated using 1H nuclear magnetic resonance spectroscopy (1H NMR), isothermal titration calorimetry and electrospray ionisation mass spectrometry.</meta:content>
