  <meta:content rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The 2PF@Q(8) complex was shown to be suitable for imaging gefitinib in prostate cancer (PC3) cells, which may help to elucidate relevant biological processes at the molecular level.</meta:content>
