  <meta:content rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">F-IDAs using Q(n)s which employ host-guest interactions between the indicator (e.g. an isoquinoline alkaloid or other dye) or analyte and the receptor Q(n)s, have been used extensively for sensing or determining non-fluorescent or weakly fluorescent analytes.</meta:content>
