  <meta:content rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">In the 1 H NMR spectrum, the H a, H b and H c protons on the acridine ring of PF showed upfield shifts in the cucurbit(8)uril complex.</meta:content>
