  <meta:content rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Cucurbit(8)uril is a macrocyclic host molecule that forms a complex with PF in the 2PF@cucurbit(8)uril fluorescent indicator.</meta:content>
