  <meta:content rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Chemistry is the scientific discipline involved with elements and compounds composed of atoms, molecules, and ions, and their composition, structure, properties, behavior, and the changes they undergo during reactions.</meta:content>
