  <meta:content rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Indicator displacement methodology is demonstrated by the fluorescence 'OFF/ON' switching, allowing control over selectivity in binding and release of the dye or analyte.</meta:content>
