  <meta:content rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A bimolecular quenching constant (kq) value of 2.5 x 10^10 M^-1 s^-1 is considered for correcting the fluorescence recovery for the complete release of AcH+ from SCX4 cavity.</meta:content>
