  <meta:content rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The AcH(+) -SCX4 complex is studied for its fluorescence decay properties at different pH values and AcCh concentrations, and is one of the main systems for which fluorescence decay parameters were measured.</meta:content>
