  <meta:content rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The studied host-guest systems have also been testified for the controlled dye displacement from the host cavity in the presence of a competitive binder cum external stimulus, acetylcholine (AcCh), which is a wellknown neurotransmitter.</meta:content>
