  <meta:content rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">(Superclass: supramolecular_fluorescence_sensor_system, off_on_fluorescence_sensor): 'Turn OFF' dye-SCX4 system is a specific type of supramolecular fluorescence sensor system and also a specific example of an OFF/ON fluorescence sensor, as it exhibits ON/OFF fluorescence behavior in response to stimuli.</meta:content>
