  <meta:content rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Cucurbit(n)urils (CB(n)) are a family of macrocyclic hosts known for their superhigh affinity for diamines and are used for molecular recognition, sensing, drug delivery, remediation, and imaging in cells.</meta:content>
