  <meta:content rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The lipophilic cavitand TCC was able to bind a trimethylammonium (R-NMe3+) tagged fluorescein derivative and accelerate its delivery into HeLa cells.</meta:content>
