  <meta:content rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">(Superclass: supramolecular_analytical_chemistry): Indicator displacement assay (IDA) is an analytical technique within the broader field of supramolecular analytical chemistry.</meta:content>
