  <meta:content rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The association constant (K a) is a value obtained using nonlinear fitting to the fluorescence spectra, measured by titration experiments, and is listed in Table 1 for ST and corresponding WP6 complex.</meta:content>
