  <meta:content rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Caffeine is one of the analytes whose 1 HNMR spectra were obtained to evaluate complexation and whose proton signals shifted upon interaction with WP6, indicating threading into the host cavity.</meta:content>
