  <meta:content rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The 2D NOESY spectrum was used to obtain NOE correlation signals between protons of caffeine and WP6, verifying the assignment for the caffeine-threaded structure.</meta:content>
