  <meta:content rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Fluorescence titrations were performed at 298 K in PBS at pH 7.2 to estimate the binding behaviours of WP6 with caffeine, theophylline, and theobromine.</meta:content>
