  <meta:content rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The guest molecule induces competitive displacement of a fluorescent dye from the CB_n hydrophobic cavity in fluorescence 'Turn-off' displacement assays.</meta:content>
