  <meta:content rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A fluorescent dye, such as dapoxyl (DAP), acridine orange (AO), palmatine (PAL), berberine (BER), or coptisine (COP), is displaced from the CB_n hydrophobic cavity in the assay.</meta:content>
