  <meta:content rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">(Superclass: host_guest_inclusion_complex): A homoternary complex is a specific type of host-guest inclusion complex where two PAL moieties stack within the CB8 cavity.</meta:content>
